ependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I'm using macOS 10.15.7 along with Xcode 12.2. I'm trying to use a custom binary cache directory by following https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/blob/master/docs/users/binarycaching.md#configuration\r\n\r\nI cloned vcpkg at tag 2020.11, then:\r\n```\r\n$ ./bootstrap-vcpkg.sh\r\n$ VCPKG_DEFAULT_BINARY_CACHE=/tmp/vcpkgcache ./vcpkg install gtest\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd nothing gets populated in /tmp/vcpkgcache. Obviously, deleting \"installed\" and \"buildtrees\" directories then re-running the above vcpkg install reconfigures and recompiles everything.\r\n\r\nI didn't try in other platforms, so at best support for VCPKG_DEFAULT_BINARY_CACHE looks incomplete or I missed some (undocumented?) step.","closed_by":{"login":"BillyONeal","id":1544943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDQ5NDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1544943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal","html_url":"https://github.com/BillyONeal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/14922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micro